{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 13096,
    "dDurationMs": 10344,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(sounds of nature)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23440,
    "dDurationMs": 10885,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(soft string music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34325,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Ashley Konon] Within twenty miles of the Wekiva river system,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36911,
    "dDurationMs": 2128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are over two million people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39039,
    "dDurationMs": 6464,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it really is a little oasis among the populated areas of Orlando."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45503,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Behind the Wild and Scenic Rivers Act was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48214,
    "dDurationMs": 4463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to maintain rivers in their natural state for future generations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52677,
    "dDurationMs": 4421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So by having a national Wild and Scenic river status,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57098,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we are really showing our commitment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58850,
    "dDurationMs": 7841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a community to keep this river in its natural state for perpetuity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66691,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(nature sounds and acoustic guitar)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70153,
    "dDurationMs": 4838,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Lee Earle] This is such a remarkable place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74991,
    "dDurationMs": 5589,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This river is only one out of two Wild and Scenic rivers in Florida."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80580,
    "dDurationMs": 6798,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you get in the kayak and head downstream and see some of the most pristine wild Florida,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87378,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, the alligators, the turtles,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90256,
    "dDurationMs": 3254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the bald eagles, the cranes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93510,
    "dDurationMs": 5338,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just the wildlife in itself is just remarkable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98848,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Katie Moncrief] What it feels like when I'm in my kayak"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103019,
    "dDurationMs": 7174,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I'm just pushing out to get out into the river is excitement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110193,
    "dDurationMs": 5839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just pure delight. I just wish more people could experience it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116032,
    "dDurationMs": 4755,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Ashley Konon] The river system really does offer something for everyone,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120787,
    "dDurationMs": 4296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whether you just wanna swim and cool off or just put your feet in the water,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125083,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or you like to paint or take pictures,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128628,
    "dDurationMs": 4505,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or just find some solitude and relax by the river,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133133,
    "dDurationMs": 7632,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or float on the river or whatever it is that helps you get through your day to day life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140765,
    "dDurationMs": 5881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I imagine the river system has some way to help you restore yourself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146646,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Jay Exum] Someone with little or no outdoor experience actually has"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150024,
    "dDurationMs": 2253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "lots of opportunities in the Wekiva system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152277,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On top of the things that you do in or associate with the river,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155530,
    "dDurationMs": 6757,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are dozens of miles of hiking trails that take you close to the river, through the sandhills,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162287,
    "dDurationMs": 4588,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through the scrub habitats on numerous different parks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166875,
    "dDurationMs": 3461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Rob Mattson] Being a national Wild and Scenic river"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170336,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kind of puts a spotlight on the Wekiva."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173006,
    "dDurationMs": 4754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think probably the main way you protect a resource like the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177760,
    "dDurationMs": 4505,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wekiva River is people need to care about it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182265,
    "dDurationMs": 6131,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and probably the best way to do that is to get them out on the river,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188396,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "especially young folks, get them out early"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190648,
    "dDurationMs": 4129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and let them experience some good times on the river"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194777,
    "dDurationMs": 5381,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that way they value it more as adults."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200158,
    "dDurationMs": 4296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Bryan Nelson] I just couldn't imagine Central Florida"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204454,
    "dDurationMs": 4421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without Wekiva Springs and Kelly Park and Rock Springs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208875,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, it's just ingrained in this area,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212629,
    "dDurationMs": 4254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this Central Florida area. We need to protect it for not only this generation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216883,
    "dDurationMs": 5213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "next generation, but for future generations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222096,
    "dDurationMs": 5047,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Lee Earle] I highly recommend that people come to the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227143,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "river and just sit and listen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230021,
    "dDurationMs": 4254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and watch, and listen to the birds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234275,
    "dDurationMs": 8133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and watch the river roll by and feel the vibration. Meditate, hum,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242408,
    "dDurationMs": 6632,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sing, dance. It's all about giving thanks for being alive"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249040,
    "dDurationMs": 4087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you really feel being alive when you're outside."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253127,
    "dDurationMs": 5381,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[Ashley Konon] I think people are amazed that this exists in Central Florida,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258508,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that if they haven't heard of it before,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261261,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they're surprised they haven't heard of it, and if they have heard of it before,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264514,
    "dDurationMs": 5255,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they're wondering why they hadn't come out sooner and explored it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 269769,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I think we feel disconnected somehow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273022,
    "dDurationMs": 3254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we've been told that we're maybe disconnected from nature,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276276,
    "dDurationMs": 4629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I would say that that is not true, that we're all connected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280905,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you live here, your water is spring water,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284784,
    "dDurationMs": 7716,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so we're all involved and invested whether we think we are or not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292500,
    "dDurationMs": 15390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(calming music)\u003e"
    } ]
  } ]
}
